sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as kueue-webhook-service<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS(cert-manager)
    participant Controller as kueue-controller-manager<br/>Workload Scheduling
    participant Visibility as Visibility API<br/>8082/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>Monitoring
    participant Metrics as Metrics Endpoint<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS mTLS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,Controller: Flow 1: Workload Admission
        User->>K8sAPI: Create Job/PyTorchJob/RayJob<br/>Auth: User credentials
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-*<br/>TLS (cert-manager)<br/>Kubernetes admission
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated resource<br/>(queue labels injected)
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-*<br/>TLS (cert-manager)<br/>Kubernetes admission
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission decision<br/>(fail-closed policy)
        K8sAPI-->>User: Resource created
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch Workloads<br/>ServiceAccount token
        Note over Controller: Evaluates quota,<br/>schedules admission
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Workload status<br/>ServiceAccount token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over User,Controller: Flow 2: Operator Reconciliation
        Note over K8sAPI: Kueue CR change detected
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Informer watch notification<br/>TLS 1.2+, SA token
        Note over Controller: TargetConfigReconciler<br/>processes Kueue CR spec
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Apply operand resources<br/>(CRDs, RBAC, Deployment,<br/>Webhooks, NetworkPolicies)<br/>TLS 1.2+, SA token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create cert-manager Issuer<br/>+ Certificate CRs<br/>TLS 1.2+, SA token
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Prometheus,Metrics: Flow 3: Metrics Collection
        Prometheus->>Metrics: GET /metrics<br/>mTLS (cert-manager)<br/>Bearer token + client cert
        Metrics-->>Prometheus: Metrics response
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note over User,Visibility: Visibility API Query
        User->>K8sAPI: GET pending workloads<br/>Auth: User credentials
        K8sAPI->>Visibility: Aggregated API request<br/>TLS (cert-manager)
        Visibility-->>K8sAPI: Pending workload list
        K8sAPI-->>User: Queue depth info
    end
